---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Bobby from '../components/Bobby.astro';
---
<Base title="Meet Bobby Nuts">
  <h1>Meet Bobby Nuts</h1>
  <div class="illus"><Bobby size={220} /></div>
  <div class="prose">
    <p>Bobby Nuts is a wee red squirrel who lives in the tall pines at the very top of Good Wood, a wood in Scotland. He is bouncy, excitable and very sweet, and he finds it very hard to keep still.</p>
    <h2>Bobby Nuts's big journey</h2>
    <p>When the nut feeders by the Squirrel Hide are taken away, Bobby Nuts is hungry and all alone. So he sets off down Good Wood, following the Burn all the way to the house at the bottom. On the way he makes new friends, and everyone helps each other.</p>
    <h2>Can you hear him?</h2>
    <p>Red squirrels are shy and hard to spot. But if you sit very quietly and very patiently, you might just hear what they're saying.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
